0..78 Comment "// A handle moved through a writer and back, as Rust writes `fn f(x: T) -> T`:"
79..153 Comment "// the handle returns under a new name, the same descriptor, and only that"
154..172 Comment "// name closes it."
174..198 Comment "// The file\'s protocols."
